    <string name="guide_title">How to Use</string>
    <string name="guide_description_1">"Clean the application site\nwith an alcohol swab\nand let it dry completely."</string>
    <string name="guide_description_2">Hold the protective cap firmly\nand twist the main body\ncounter-clockwise\nto separate it from the cap.</string>
    <string name="guide_description_3">Place the applicator\nhorizontally against the skin at\nthe application site.</string>
    <string name="guide_description_4">Place your palm on top of the\napplicator and press down\nfirmly until you hear a click.</string>
    <string name="guide_description_5">Lift the applicator away from\nyour body. Ensure the\ntransmitter is securely\nattached to your skin.</string>
    <string name="guide_description_6">Press around the adhesive pad\nwith your fingers to ensure it is\nfirmly stuck to your skin.</string>
    <string name="guide_tip_1">Application site: Around 10cm to\nthe left or right of the navel.</string>
